  "description": "<p><strong>Onkyo A-905X Receiver + T-405X Tuner</strong></p>\r\n<p><em>Specificaties:</em></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1pk76sd\" data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"157\">Onkyo A-905X (versterker)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"521\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9r4zya\" data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"215\">Type: geïntegreerde stereo versterker (INTEC 205 serie)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3p53k\" data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"282\">Uitgangsvermogen: circa 2 × 45 W (8 ohm, afhankelijk van meting)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3q6n7y\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"318\">Frequentiebereik: 10 Hz – 100 kHz</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wn3ent\" data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"364\">Aansluitingen: CD, tuner, tape, MD ingangen</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xh0dtl\" data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"405\">Pre-out: aanwezig (subwoofer mogelijk)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"526\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ra3ryo\" data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"551\">Onkyo T-405X (tuner)</h2>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xry0q\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"571\">Type: FM/AM tuner</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbsvgq\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"611\">FM bereik: 87,5 – 108 MHz (EU-versie)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxz6q1\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"659\">AM bereik: 522 – 1611 kHz (afhankelijk regio)</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfv93a\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"699\">Presets: ongeveer 30 geheugenplaatsen</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e6nvzh\" data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"743\">Signaal-ruisverhouding FM: circa 70–73 dB</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfjitn\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"792\">Extra functies: timer, RI-systeemondersteuning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>extra informatie:</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Werkt uitstekend</li>\r\n<li>Verkeert in goede staat<br><br>Garantie:<br>1 MAAND GARANTIE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Bij ons: € 69.99<strong><br></strong></strong></p>",
